error[ffi_constant_type]: `BIG_COUNT` is `long long` in `fixedbugs-186-results.h`, not `i32` — clang read the header and the types disagree
  at tests/golden/unsupported/fixedbugs-186-a-constant-the-header-gives-another-type.hero:8:5
    |
  8 |     constant BIG_COUNT: i32  #~ ffi_constant_type
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  note: an `extern constant` takes its value and its type from the header (§4.19), and is declared at that type or one that holds every value of it — or the header named is not the one that spells `BIG_COUNT` as `i32`
  fix (guess): declare it `i64`

